{"lang":"en","summary":"Navigation: RAG技术MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"父文档-子块索引策略与实现\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"RAG技术\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> advanced\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/RAG技术\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/advanced</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/05-RAG%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/RAG%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AFMOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/05-RAG%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/RAG%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AFMOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">RAG技术MOC</a></p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">\n## 问题\n什么是父文档-子块（Parent-Document / Small-to-Big）索引策略？它解决了什么问题？如何实现？\n\n## 答案\n\n**父文档-子块策略**是一种 RAG 索引优化技术：检索时使用**小粒度 Chunk**（子块）做向量匹配，生成时使用**大粒度文档**（父文档）作为上下文。\n\n**核心思想：**\n\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\">传统 RAG：<br>\n大文档 ──切分──▶ [Chunk 1] [Chunk 2] [Chunk 3] ...<br>\n检索和生成都用 Chunk（粒度一致）<br>\n问题：Chunk 太小则生成缺上下文，Chunk 太大则检索精度低</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">父文档-子块策略：<br>\n大文档 ──切分──▶ [Chunk 1] [Chunk 2] [Chunk 3] ...<br>\n│         │         │<br>\n▼         ▼         ▼<br>\n[父文档 A] [父文档 A] [父文档 B]</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">  检索：用 Chunk 做向量匹配（小粒度 = 高精度）<br>\n生成：用 Chunk 对应的父文档作为上下文（大粒度 = 完整信息）</p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">\n**解决的问题：**\n\n| 问题 | 说明 | 父文档策略如何解决 |\n|------|------|-------------------|\n| **检索精度 vs 上下文完整性的矛盾** | 小 Chunk 检索准但信息少，大 Chunk 信息多但检索不准 | 小 Chunk 检索 + 大文档生成 |\n| **跨 Chunk 语义断裂** | 相关 Chunk 分散在多个位置 | 父文档提供完整上下文 |\n| **实体指代不明** | \"该公司\"\"此产品\"等指代需要前文 | 父文档包含完整指代信息 |\n\n**实现方式（LangChain）：**\n\n```python\nfrom langchain.retrievers import ParentDocumentRetriever\nfrom langchain.storage import InMemoryStore\nfrom langchain_chroma import Chroma\nfrom langchain_text_splitters import RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter\nfrom langchain_openai import OpenAIEmbeddings\n\n# 子块切分器（小粒度，用于检索）\nchild_splitter = RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter(chunk_size=200, chunk_overlap=50)\n\n# 父文档切分器（大粒度，用于生成）\nparent_splitter = RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter(chunk_size=1000, chunk_overlap=200)\n\n# 向量数据库（存子块向量）\nvectorstore = Chroma(\n    collection_name=\"parent_doc\",\n    embedding_function=OpenAIEmbeddings()\n)\n\n# 文档存储（存父文档）\nstore = InMemoryStore()\n\n# 创建 ParentDocumentRetriever\nretriever = ParentDocumentRetriever(\n    vectorstore=vectorstore,\n    docstore=store,\n    child_splitter=child_splitter,\n    parent_splitter=parent_splitter\n)\n\n# 添加文档\nretriever.add_documents(documents)\n\n# 查询：用子块向量匹配，返回父文档\nresults = retriever.invoke(\"查询问题\")\n# results 中是完整的父文档，而非小 chunk\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>另一种实现：Sentence Window Retrieval</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> langchain<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>retrievers <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> SentenceWindowRetriever\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 检索时返回目标句子 + 前后扩展窗口</span>\nretriever <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> SentenceWindowRetriever<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    vectorstore<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>vectorstore<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    window_size<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">3</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 前后各3句</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>不同索引策略对比：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>检索粒度</th>\n<th>生成粒度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>普通 Chunk</td>\n<td>Chunk</td>\n<td>Chunk</td>\n<td>通用场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>父文档-子块</strong></td>\n<td>小 Chunk</td>\n<td>大文档/父文档</td>\n<td>需要完整上下文的场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Sentence Window</strong></td>\n<td>句子</td>\n<td>句子+前后窗口</td>\n<td>文本连贯性要求高的场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Auto-merging</strong></td>\n<td>小 Chunk</td>\n<td>自动合并相关 Chunk</td>\n<td>相关 Chunk 分散的场景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Q: 父文档策略的存储成本如何？</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">A: 需要存储两份数据：子块向量 + 父文档原文。存储成本约为普通策略的 1.5-2 倍，但生成质量显著提升。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Q: 父文档过大超过 LLM 上下文窗口怎么办？</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">A: 1) 使用 Map-Reduce 策略分段处理；2) 对父文档做二次摘要；3) 设置父文档大小上限。</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h2>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>父文档越大越好</strong> — 父文档过大可能超过 LLM 上下文窗口，需要权衡</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>子块越小越好</strong> — 子块过小可能丢失关键语义，影响检索精度</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>所有场景都用父文档策略</strong> — 简单场景下普通 Chunk 策略更直接</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h3 data-heading=\"&lt;a id=&quot;q17&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Q17: 查询重写(Query Rewriting)有哪些技术？HyDE 是什么？\" dir=\"auto\"><a id=\"q17\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"></a>Q17: 查询重写(Query Rewriting)有哪些技术？HyDE 是什么？</h3>\n<pre class=\"language-yaml\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"></code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>","headings":[]}